@startuml network_audio_handover
!theme cyborg
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #0b1018
skinparam defaultFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam ArrowColor #a9b8ca
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
title When may audio start after Start? Network-to-audio handover
participant CONTROL
participant COMMUNICATION
participant WIFI
participant PORTAL
database STORAGE
participant AUDIO
note over CONTROL
 Start during Analysing: Busy, nothing cancelled.
 Start during Sending: cancels the delivery job.
end note
CONTROL -> COMMUNICATION : Start: communication_postEvent(LISTENING_STARTED)\nwithdraws the network lease
CONTROL -> COMMUNICATION : communication_waitForWiFiStop(timeout)\nCONTROL sends no other event during the wait
note right of COMMUNICATION
 Seen at the next event check; 200 ms is a candidate
 check interval, not a bound on teardown or flash writes.
end note
group Cancel the operation in progress, once (in-line)
 COMMUNICATION -> WIFI : cancel scan, disconnect join, cancel SNTP\nor cancel TLS setup/exchange (1 s stop bound)
 WIFI --> COMMUNICATION : released, or not confirmed
 note over WIFI
  Stale completions rejected: SNTP, TLS and DNS check the
  operation generation; scan results are no longer accepted.
 end note
end
opt Settings commit pending
 COMMUNICATION -> STORAGE : finish wifi/network write (up to 2 tries)\nor Device registration record save
 note right of STORAGE
  Not interrupted by Start. Atomicity and power-loss
  behavior remain target evidence.
 end note
end
group Cleanup pass: one stop try per service still pending (1 s each)
 COMMUNICATION -> WIFI : time synchronization, secure connection,\nscan, connect request
 COMMUNICATION -> PORTAL : stop setup page (HTTP server); queued requests discarded
 COMMUNICATION -> WIFI : stop DHCP server, stop hotspot
end
note over WIFI
 Retained, not work: station association and a dormant verified TLS connection.
end note
alt All stops confirmed
 COMMUNICATION --> CONTROL : release acknowledged (state Stopped)
 CONTROL -> AUDIO : admit audio: prime and start
else A stop failed: latch WIFI_CLEANUP_FAILURE (REQ-13 Wi-Fi-only exception)
 COMMUNICATION -> COMMUNICATION : network work disabled until restart;\nfailed services stay recorded
 COMMUNICATION --> CONTROL : release acknowledged without proof of quiescence\nno claim that the radio is off
 CONTROL -> AUDIO : admit audio: prime and start
else Release not provable: no acknowledgement within CONTROL's wait
 CONTROL -> CONTROL : audio stays stopped; show the reason
end
note over CONTROL, COMMUNICATION
 Coalescing: COMMUNICATION acts on the latest requested state only.
 A Stop before the acknowledgement leaves listening unrequested; a new
 Start needs a new acknowledgement. CONTROL serializes Start/Stop with the wait.
end note
@enduml
